# Conversation length

Keep the next similar turn inside one task. When a thread is already long, start a fresh chat for the next task.

A long thread gets dearer per turn because every turn resends context. Cache read grows with the thread, and later turns pay that volume again.

Start a fresh chat after a long idle gap. Do not resume a thread whose cache write dominates.
